This Licence applies to the KrakenSDR DoA software: everything in the
kraken_doa_v2 folder of the KrakenSDR suite
(https://github.com/krakenrf/krakensdr_suite), including its decoder plugins
and their plugin library, its web pages, tools, scripts and documentation,
except where a file or folder says that it is under a different licence (see
section 6: the plugin SDK, the Windows helpers and the decoder plugins with a
