royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence, for Permitted Use
only, to:

  (a) run and use the Software;
  (b) read, study and copy its source code;
  (c) modify it and make works based on it ("Modified Versions"); and
  (d) distribute copies of the Software and of Modified Versions, in source
      code or object code form, as set out in section 3.

You may not sublicense the Software except as section 3 allows.


3. Distribution

When You distribute the Software or a Modified Version, You must:

  (a) distribute it free of charge (You may recover only the actual cost of
