4. Commercial use and other uses

This Licence does not permit Commercial Use, or any other use that is not
Permitted Use. That use requires a Commercial Licence from the Licensor. An
organisation evaluating the Software needs one as soon as it starts to use
the Software operationally, and at the latest when its Evaluation Period
ends. For details, contact:

    krakenrf@krakensdr.com

A Commercial Licence includes the Licensor's standard commercial terms
(COMMERCIAL_TERMS.md in the kraken_doa_v2 folder) unless it says otherwise.
A separate licence agreed in writing with the Licensor takes precedence over
this Licence for the licensee who agreed to it.


