9. Lawful use

The Software can receive, decode, record and locate radio transmissions. The
laws on receiving, decoding, recording, disclosing and using radio
transmissions, on privacy and on direction finding differ between countries.
You are responsible for using the Software lawfully. This Licence does not
give permission to receive, decode or use any transmission.


